            ((currX >= (fovX - (fovWidthMidPre + paraLength + periLength))) && (currX <= (fovX + (fovWidthMidPost + paraLength + periLength))) && (currY >= (fovY - (fovWidthMidPre + paraLength + periLength))) && (currY < (fovY - (fovWidthMidPre + paraLength)))) ||
